Z||000000||xfilesgirl1||10-06-2000||05:52 PM||||Help,<BR>I looked a beautiful fiero two days ago and fell in love with it. wanna buy it. but my dad doesn't want me to. I have one question than i really need an answer for: Has anyone's fan pipes ever been cut. If so...how did you cut them. This is one of my dad's major concerns.<P>thanks a bunch,<BR>oh and it's a 1985 Fiero coupe. It doesn't have the original motor in it.<P>thnx,<BR>Alisa <BR>||||reg||1
