Z||000003||MikeSchaefer||10-06-2000||06:19 PM||||Sounds like your father has been talking to a fiero-hater.  They start lots of these weird rumors.<BR>Michael Schaefer <A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A> ||||reg||4
Z||000004||terryk||10-06-2000||06:25 PM||||Tell him they *are* really dangerous but he'll save in in the long run on college costs.<P>Make sure the Johnson orifice is concentric too. If not, you'll need a Foxworthy 2000 Steller Modified Spanner wrench to correct it.||||reg||1
