Z||000039||stimpy||10-08-2000||04:21 PM||||I can tell ya , if anyone was giving my 15 year old niece advice about doing "it" in a Fiero and I caught up with him, broken ribs would be the least of the worries.  She's a kid for cryin out loud... any freakin pedophiles in here better get up on out.  Damn, I hate people perving out on kids!<P><BR>Anyway, xfilesgirl, good luck on your Fiero hunt. I can tell you that there is no car I'd rather see my niece start driving in then a 4 cyl automatic Fiero.  I would stay aay from a V6 until you have some good experience behind the wheel, but as others have posted before me, the Fiero is a very safe car in accidents. <P>------------------<BR>Loud Pipes Save Lives!      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/stimpy_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
