Z||000051||DaRkLoRD||10-10-2000||01:08 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by stimpy:<BR><B> Oh geez, my bad! Sounds like a charming invitation to a 15 year old. I should just lighten up. We need more knocked up, messed up 15 year olds in the world.<P>I'll just go take my Prozac now.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>From the responses to this thread, I gather many people here didn't notice her age.. (I did..) <P>Just about every female here has attracted the attention of the majority of the male forum members, and often gets a lot of flirtatious comments and innuendo(sp?) unless they are initially introduced as someone's wife etc..<P>point is, unless people openly state their age, gender, ethnic background, religion etc... there's always a chance that someone will unknowingly say something that someone else will find inappropriate. (I'm not saying I think everyone should do this.. but if they did, then situations like this might be avoided.)<P>anyway, I think this issue was taken a bit too seriously, it was just a couple of guys joking around with a new forum member...<P>------------------<BR>  <A HREF="mailto:steve@fieroproject.com">steve@fieroproject.com</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fieroproject.com</A>||||reg||1
