Z||000054||baldlobo||10-10-2000||05:06 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by xfilesgirl1:<BR><B><P>hi,<BR>I've saw the ad for the white 84 in winnipeg but my dad says to look for a 85-88 because of the recall on the 84's.Brandon is a long way for me. It's like a 2 1/2 hr. drive or something. I live just outisde of lockport and selkirk.<BR>thnx,<BR>Ali<P> </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>there isn't anything bad about 84's. It's just because they were the first to catch on fire and that's why they have a bad rep, or else my second theory is that your dad wants more horsepower for when he drives it(85 intro of V6) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.||||reg||6
